ace?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_12","text":"Of course not.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_13","text":"I thought I might have to handle administrative tasks for this event,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_14","text":"but I don't have much experience with this kind of festival,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_15","text":"so I wanted to see","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_16","text":"if you knew anything about this event.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_17","text":"Actually, I was lying earlier. I have heard about this festival before.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_18","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_19","text":"Really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_20","text":"How much do you know?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_21","text":"Tell me everything.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_22","text":"Well, for one thing, it's happening in the evening.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_23","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_24","text":"I heard there will be fireworks.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_25","text":"Oooh,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_26","text":"that'll be great!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_27","text":"For sure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_28","text":"So,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_29","text":"um...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_30","text":"do you have to work that day, by any chance?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_31","text":"I mean,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_32","text":"considering that there will be fireworks at an official Ark-based event,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_33","text":"you and I could go out for a joint inspection.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_34","text":"Are you asking me on a date to go see the fireworks?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_35","text":"Ugh, in your dreams!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_04_36"